WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.085 --> 00:00:02.117
It was Saturday.

2
00:00:02.118 --> 00:00:05.859
Wacky Wayne's Used Cars was having a huge sale.

3
00:00:05.860 --> 00:00:08.700
Customers walked around the car lot.

4
00:00:08.701 --> 00:00:11.741
Wacky Wayne tried to sell a van to a woman.

5
00:00:11.742 --> 00:00:13.398
"I don't like it."

6
00:00:13.399 --> 00:00:15.986
The woman pointed to a red sports car.

7
00:00:15.987 --> 00:00:18.624
"How about that one?"

8
00:00:18.625 --> 00:00:21.748
Wayne frowned. "That's my own car.

9
00:00:21.749 --> 00:00:23.997
But here's another one you might like."

10
00:00:23.998 --> 00:00:27.105
He led her over to a green car.

11
00:00:27.106 --> 00:00:29.302
The door had a huge dent.

12
00:00:29.303 --> 00:00:31.259
Wayne jumped in front of the dent.

13
00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:33.831
"Take it for a test drive. I'm sure you'll—"

14
00:00:33.832 --> 00:00:37.393
Whoosh! The green car rose from the ground.

15
00:00:37.394 --> 00:00:40.046
"Wow!" a boy yelled.

16
00:00:40.047 --> 00:00:44.459
"It's a flying car! Can we get it, Dad?"

17
00:00:44.460 --> 00:00:46.350
A few more cars rose.

18
00:00:46.351 --> 00:00:49.845
People watched as they floated off the lot.

19
00:00:49.846 --> 00:00:52.568
"What's going on?" Wayne cried.

20
00:00:52.569 --> 00:00:57.564
"Those cars are leaving my lot!"

21
00:00:57.565 --> 00:01:00.214
The cars lined themselves up on the street.

22
00:01:00.215 --> 00:01:10.105
Then they rolled onto a car carrier.

23
00:01:10.106 --> 00:01:14.183
Bar-room! The car carrier's engine turned on.

24
00:01:14.184 --> 00:01:18.534
It drove down the street.

25
00:01:18.535 --> 00:01:21.159
A teenager sat in the driver's seat.

26
00:01:21.160 --> 00:01:27.215
She glanced in the rearview mirror at the stolen cars and laughed.

27
00:01:27.216 --> 00:01:33.274
"See you soon, Rocket Girl!"

28
00:01:33.275 --> 00:01:36.768
*** Roxy, Jack, and Terrell were sitting in Mara's

29
00:01:36.769 --> 00:01:39.301
backyard. Mara appeared from behind a bedsheet curtain.

30
00:01:39.302 --> 00:01:41.305
She was dressed as a magician.

31
00:01:41.306 --> 00:01:44.108
Her friends clapped and cheered.

32
00:01:44.109 --> 00:01:47.385
Mara took a bow. "Thank you.

33
00:01:47.386 --> 00:01:51.409
My first trick is called the dancing coin."

34
00:01:51.410 --> 00:01:53.342
She pulled a penny from her pocket.

35
00:01:53.343 --> 00:01:56.811
"Jack, please examine the coin."

36
00:01:56.812 --> 00:01:59.092
Jack looked the penny over carefully.

37
00:01:59.093 --> 00:02:02.075
"It looks like a regular penny to me."

38
00:02:02.076 --> 00:02:10.345
"Good. Now I, Mara the Magnificent, will make this ordinary penny dance."

39
00:02:10.346 --> 00:02:14.746
She waved her hand. The coin spun!

40
00:02:14.747 --> 00:02:18.836
"Whoa!" Jack said. "How do you do that?"

41
00:02:18.837 --> 00:02:22.167
"Magic, of course," Mara said.

42
00:02:22.168 --> 00:02:24.666
"I know the secret," Terrell said.

43
00:02:24.667 --> 00:02:27.735
"You have a magnet in your glove, right?"

44
00:02:27.736 --> 00:02:34.326
Mara smiled. "Mara the Magnificent never reveals her secrets."

45
00:02:34.327 --> 00:02:37.725
Just then Roxy's watch beeped.

46
00:02:37.726 --> 00:02:41.739
"Um, I'll go get us some more juice," Roxy said.

47
00:02:41.740 --> 00:02:45.718
Roxy hurried into Mara's kitchen.

48
00:02:45.719 --> 00:02:48.298
"What's up, Mayor?" Roxy said.

49
00:02:48.299 --> 00:02:51.807
"A bunch of cars are up," Mayor Bloom said.

50
00:02:51.808 --> 00:02:54.664
"What do you mean?" Roxy asked.

51
00:02:54.665 --> 00:02:56.907
Mayor Bloom shook his head.

52
00:02:56.908 --> 00:03:01.645
"This sounds strange, but cars floated off Wacky Wayne's lot.

53
00:03:01.646 --> 00:03:06.259
Whoever did this made the cars fly—without even touching them.

54
00:03:06.260 --> 00:03:09.530
I think there's a car thief in Metro City."

55
00:03:09.531 --> 00:03:12.878
"That does sound strange," Roxy said.

56
00:03:12.879 --> 00:03:14.688
"But don't worry, Mayor Bloom.

57
00:03:14.689 --> 00:03:18.906
I'll find out what's going on!"

